      "content": "it's just not just \"internal struggles\" though. it's real. like, my sister is struggling with her job and it's mostly because i messed up that thing last year. my parents are constantly stressed because of my finances. it's like i'm a black hole of stress for everyone. i feel like if i wasn't even in the picture, everyone would finally have the space to breathe and just... be happy.",
